flowchart LR
  SRC[source commit\n+ manifest hash] --> RUN[campaign run]
  DATA[dataset bytes\n+ sha256] --> RUN
  ENV[environment.json] --> RUN
  RUN --> RAW[raw per-unit observations]
  RAW --> SUMM[result summarizer]
  RAW --> VER[independent verifier\nrecompute + replay]
  SUMM --> CLAIM[claim-to-evidence entries]
  VER --> STATUS[passed / failed / blocked / unverified]
  CLAIM --> REPORT[research report figures]
  STATUS --> REPORT
